From ff8783c31053d91dbb89d545e1be4fdc88ba412b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 02:16:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Deepen FireOpsSim integration with return URLs, focus drills,
 and expanded prep tasks

Add centralized FireOpsSim link builders that pass source=roadmap and firepath://
return_url on every outbound handoff. Wire Daily Focus practice sessions to
focus-drills.html, expand built-in preparation tasks beyond pumper-only coverage,
cache the FireOpsSim taskbook catalog for richer companion links, and register
firepath:// deep links so users can return from FireOpsSim to record progress.
